<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>New to Bitcoin — start here | BTCisGTO</title><meta name="description" content="A learning path to Bitcoin concepts, original sources, security questions, and practice tools."><link rel="canonical" href="https://btcisgto.cloud/orange-pill/"><meta property="og:title" content="New to Bitcoin — start here | BTCisGTO"><meta property="og:description" content="A learning path to Bitcoin concepts, original sources, security questions, and practice tools."><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:url" content="https://btcisgto.cloud/orange-pill/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/mission-v1.css"><script src="/assets/mission-v1.js" defer></script></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header"><div class="shell header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="BTCisGTO home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">₿</span>BTC<span>is</span>GTO</a><button class="menu-button" aria-controls="main-nav" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button><nav class="nav" id="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/tools/" >Tools</a><a href="/goal/" >The mission</a><a href="/treasury/" >Treasury</a><a href="/building/" >Build log</a><a href="/learn/" aria-current="page">Learn</a></nav><a class="btn primary header-cta" href="/tradingtool/">Start practicing ↗</a></div></header><main id="main"><div class="shell"><div class="page-head"><div class="eyebrow">New to Bitcoin</div><h1>Start with questions.<br><em>Take your time.</em></h1><p>You do not need to buy anything to start learning. Understanding the system comes before choosing whether or how to use it.</p></div></div><div class="shell"><article class="prose"><h2>What are you trying to understand?</h2><p>Start with the roles of transactions, digital signatures, proof of work, and the network. The original whitepaper is a useful primary source; it is not a complete guide to modern wallets or personal financial decisions.</p><h2>Ask practical questions</h2><ul><li>Who controls the keys, and what happens if they are lost?</li><li>What does a transaction cost, and when is it confirmed?</li><li>What information becomes public?</li><li>How would price changes affect the purpose you have in mind?</li></ul><h2>Use primary sources</h2><p>Read the <a href="/whitepaper/">Bitcoin whitepaper</a>, explore the <a href="https://bitcoin.org/en/how-it-works" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bitcoin overview</a>, and compare what you learn with the data in the <a href="/dashboard/">Bitcoin Dashboard</a>.</p><h2>Keep learning separate from spending</h2><p>The Trading Sim provides a place to practice order mechanics with simulated points. It does not require sending Bitcoin or SOL, and practice profits cannot be withdrawn.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/whitepaper/">Read the whitepaper <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn " href="/tradingtool/">Try the simulator <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="shell"><div class="footer-top"><div><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="BTCisGTO home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">₿</span>BTC<span>is</span>GTO</a><p>Bitcoin. Truth. Compassion.<br>Useful tools. A public journey.<br>A long road toward Lola’s HOME.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><div><strong>Use</strong><a href="/tradingtool/">Trading Sim</a><a href="/edge/">Edge Tool</a><a href="/dashboard/">Bitcoin Dashboard</a></div><div><strong>Understand</strong><a href="/about/">Jay’s story</a><a href="/playbook/">The playbook</a><a href="/belief-system/">Belief system</a><a href="/whitepaper/">Bitcoin whitepaper</a></div><div><strong>Follow</strong><a href="https://youtube.com/@btcisgto" rel="noopener" target="_blank">YouTube ↗</a><a href="https://x.com/btcisgto" rel="noopener" target="_blank">X ↗</a><a href="ht